et me look for the run scripts and server setup files.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: maybe the controller is at a different address. The prompt says url http://127.0.0.1:8666. But maybe it's the gateway host. Let me scan the docker network gateway 172.18.0.1 and the proxy 172.18.0.2.\n\nMy earlier scan only found .4 and .5. Let me check the remaining scan sessions."}}
